			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — Notification delegation completion and provider lifecycle symmetry\n\nAdvance the Element submodule pointer to 536326f2, integrating updates across Cache, Mountain, and Vine.\n\nCache reformats documentation comments in Library.rs for improved readability.\n\nMountain completes the systematic decomposition of the gRPC notification surface by delegating all remaining handlers to the Vine crate. Convert CocoonService and MountainService trait imports to use canonical definitions from ::Vine::Generated, eliminating local re-exports. Server-side notification modules (UpdateScmGroup, WebviewLifecycle, RelayToSky, provider unregistration) are now thin shims forwarding to Vine::Server::Notification. Client-side Shared module and stub implementations are reduced to empty pass-throughs.\n\nVine implements the symmetrical provider unregistration surface — UnregisterRemoteAuthorityResolver, UnregisterScmProvider, UnregisterTaskProvider, and UnregisterUriHandler — all integrating with the central UnregisterByHandle utility. Add WebviewLifecycle notification to canonicalize Cocoon's positional arrays into named-key objects before emitting to Sky renderer channels. Implement UpdateScmGroup notification with SCM marker persistence via VineHost::UpdateScmGroupMarkers for boot-time replay. Enhance UnregisterFileSystemProvider with scheme logging for diagnostic observability.\n\nMountain is now a pure composition layer with all Cocoon→Mountain IPC delegated to the shared Vine crate. The provider lifecycle is fully symmetrical with clean disposal pathways, and SCM/webview state persists across page reloads.",
			"SHA": "efe952b0cc9cc6e1b5f0801256070857254c5256"
		},
