			"Message": "build(Land): Register Cache crate in workspace Cargo.toml\n\nAdd the new `Cache` crate to the workspace `members` array and declare its local path dependency in the `[dependencies]` section. This follows the `Element` submodule update that introduces the standalone Cache element for centralizing asset mapping and path canonicalization logic previously housed within Mountain.\n\nThe Cache crate will decouple Mountain's internal caching mechanisms, aligning with the ongoing modularization effort to delegate specialized functionality to dedicated crates (Air, Vine, Cache).",
			"SHA": "22e00a80dff2eaaca0e03fec04df3d9b22db9081"
