			"Message": "build(Land): Register Vine crate in workspace Cargo.toml\n\nAdd the new `Vine` crate to the workspace `members` array and declare its local path dependency so the gRPC protocol crate is included in the monorepo build graph.\n\nThis completes the workspace-level wiring started when the Vine Protobuf/Rust component was introduced under `Element/Vine/`.",
